OL,3,GNEWSARocks help to hold back sea in
OL,4,A#20m road work
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #20m scheme to protect a
OL,7,Fstorm-battered village has started as
OL,8,Flocals prepare for the area's seascape
OL,9,Fto change.
OL,11,FAbout 60,000 tonnes of boulders have
OL,12,Farrived to create "rock armour" to
OL,13,Fprotect the shore at Torcross, near
OL,14,FKingsbridge, Devon, from the impact of
OL,15,Fthe sea.
OL,17,FIt comes after part of the A379 coast
OL,18,Froad was washed away earlier this year.
OL,19,FLocals said they were sad to lose part
OL,20,Fof the beach, but understood resilience
OL,21,Fwas needed.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
