OL,3,GNEWSARocks help to hold back sea in
OL,4,A#20m road work
OL,5,
OL,6,FGeorge Arnison, from the Environment
OL,7,FAgency, said work was being carried out
OL,8,F"at a very accelerated pace, which has
OL,9,Fbeen a challenge" to get the scheme in
OL,10,Fplace to absorb wave energy and reduce
OL,11,Ferosion. It is work estimated to be
OL,12,Fcompleted in April 2027.
